        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Don-Jo GLP-307, Storefront Door Security Latch Guard</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nProtect your storefront door from tampering and latch prying with this steel security latch protector plate. No special tools required for installation. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis security door latch protector is 7\" high and designed specifically for store front doors with Adams Rite type <a href=\"/products/storefront-door-mortise-lock-deadlatch-body-th1103\"><b>Mortise Deadlatch</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/storefront-door-mortise-lock-deadbolt-body-th1101\"><b>Mortise Deadbolt</b></a> or <a href=\"/products/sliding-door-mortise-lock-hookbolt-body-th1102\"><b>Mortise Hookbolt</b></a>. The mounting bolt & rivet go through the door and are attached on the inside with the included fasteners. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/don-jo-GLP-307_size.gif?v=1704354648\" width=\"580\" height=\"250\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Don-Jo GLP-307 Security Latch Guard size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nHanded, for outswinging doors. Fits over lock cylinder so the <a href=\"/products/1-inch-brass-mortise-cylinder-lock-for-storefront-door-th1100-bc\"><b>Mortise Lock Cylinder</b></a> does not require removal when installing. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMade of 2 different materials in 3 finish choices. <br>\r\n*Steel: Painted Silver or Duro (Dark Bronze) finishes.<br>\r\n*Stainless Steel: Satin Stainless Steel finish.<br>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for Don-Jo GLP-307 Security Latch Guard\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 7\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Thickness: 1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Steel / Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Offset: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Handed (non-reversible)</li>\r\n<li>Fasteners: (1) each 5/16-18 x 2-1/4\" Carriage bolt with Acorn nut and washer, plus drive-in rivet.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GLP-307-LHR.pdf?v=1704262233\" target=\"new\"><b>Don-Jo GLP-307 Security Plate, Left Hand Door, Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GLP-307-RHR.pdf?v=1704262233\" target=\"new\"><b>Don-Jo GLP-307 Security Plate, Right Hand Door, Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p><b>*Sold Individually. </b>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Storefront Door Security Latch Guard, Don-Jo GLP-307",
                "description": "Don-Jo GLP-307  latch protectors. This door latch protector is 7 inches high and designed specifically for store front doors with a Mortise Deadlatch or deadbolt.The bolt & rivet go through the door and are attached on the inside with the included fasteners. Handed, for use on  outswinging doors. Fits over lock cylinder so the Mortise Lock Cylinder does not require removal when installing. ",
                "keywords": "DJO-GLP-307, don-jo glp-307 7 inch latch protectors, security plates, door jamb protectors, steel door jamb plates, steel plates, aluminum doors, aluminum door protectors, aluminum jambs, aluminum door plates, steel door plates, latch protectors, door security plates, Store front Door Latch Guards, anti vandal plates, door Security plates, Don-Jo GLP-307 Latch Guards, Don-Jo GLP-307-SL, Don-Jo GLP-307-DU, Don-Jo GLP-307-630"
